    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d580">

                <pb facs="0648" n="568" xml:id="pg568"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Jackson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-01-06"><hi rendition="#italic">January 6,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to your predecessor’s No.
                    104, of the 13th ultimo, reporting the visit of the U. S. S. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hartford</hi> to the Piraeus, I now inclose for your
                    information the report of that visit as made by the commanding officer of the
                    vessel.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>



